[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 12422.389, "timestamp": "03:27:02", "text": "呃，问问题什么的。那会是……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12425.349, "timestamp": "03:27:05", "text": "好的。但现在的问题是，我正在做乔森"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12429.91, "timestamp": "03:27:09", "text": "现在。所以我要直播24小时，也就是12个小时。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12432.15, "timestamp": "03:27:12", "text": "第一部分 第二部分。所以人们不会知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12434.83, "timestamp": "03:27:14", "text": "所以我想，我应该喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12437.59, "timestamp": "03:27:17", "text": "从现在起正式宣布此事，以便"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12439.99, "timestamp": "03:27:19", "text": "人们可以在特定时间参与。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12442.469, "timestamp": "03:27:22", "text": "当事件发生时，例如"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12445.11, "timestamp": "03:27:25", "text": "所有这些合作都会发生"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12448.229, "timestamp": "03:27:28", "text": "东西。不，因为它是连续流动。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12449.469, "timestamp": "03:27:29", "text": "溪流。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 12479.63, "timestamp": "03:27:59", "text": "我的世界"}]